"This is brilliant."

491
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:42,080
-爽翻了。
-因为，斯提格……
-It's amazing.
-'Cause, the Stig...

492
00:25:42,120 --> 00:25:44,120
斯提格确实说过，
他从没见过有人像你这样……
照他的原话说，
The Stig did say that
he's never met anyone who,
I think he put it,

493
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:46,240
“这么能胡逼瞎搞”。
"dicks about" as much as you.

494
00:25:47,800 --> 00:25:50,120
-我们玩得挺开心的。
-是啊，他……
-We had a laugh.
-Yeah, he...

495
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:52,920
我是说，真的很有意思。我们打滑失控了
好几次。蛮好玩的，真的很棒。
I mean, it was fun. We spun
out a couple of times. It was
kind of fun. And it was good.

496
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:55,640
-有人想看他打转甩尾的画面吗？
-观众：想！
-Anyone want to see
one of those spins?
-AUDIENCE: Yes.

497
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:58,440
我们来看看，因为我觉得
我们刚好拍到了一次。
Let's see, because I think
we may have just
captured one here.

498
00:25:58,480 --> 00:26:00,600
来看看这段。
Let's have a look at this.

499
00:26:00,640 --> 00:26:03,600
-哦，照例又是倒数第二个弯角，而且……
-卡尔：要来了。
-Oh, second to last corner,
as is usual and...
-CARR: Here we go.

500
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:07,200
完美。完美的走线。
漂亮。
Perfect. Perfect racing line.
Yeah.

501
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:09,720
来喽。哇哦！
哈，走你！
There you go. Whoa!
Yeah, there you go!

502
00:26:11,800 --> 00:26:15,640
