阿斯顿·马丁吗，求你了？
I'm so sorry,
but can I have a go
in the Aston Martin, please?

504
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:20,640
[全场大笑]
[ALL LAUGHING]

505
00:26:25,280 --> 00:26:27,240
-不行。
-求你了？
-No.
-Please?

506
00:26:27,280 --> 00:26:28,960
其实是这么回事，杰里米……
Thing about that, Jeremy...

507
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:31,720
问题在于，
我这张小脸
套进头盔里，
The thing about that
is my little face
in a crash helmet.

508
00:26:31,760 --> 00:26:35,000
活像个被关在电梯里的死胖墩。
It looks like a fat kid
that's been shut in a lift.

509
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:41,200
不过我最喜欢的是摄像团队。
他们都在对讲机里喊：
Well, what I loved was
the camera crews. They're
all on the radios going,

510
00:26:41,240 --> 00:26:44,520
“内个……我们能不能
站得比平时再靠后一点？”
"Would it be all right
if we stood a bit further back
than usual?"

511
00:26:44,560 --> 00:26:47,040
因为你整个人散发着一种
在极速狂飙中作死胡闹的气质。
Because there was
this sense of dicking about
at enormous speed.

512
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:50,280
听起来你手握方向盘的时候
胆子挺肥啊。
It sounds like you're quite
brave behind the wheel
of a car.

