Yeah, that's not bad.

1058
00:56:04,960 --> 00:56:08,040
好的，现在进入芝加哥弯。
Right, and into Chicago here.

1059
00:56:08,080 --> 00:56:10,560
哎哟，车身猛烈晃了一下。
Oops, bit of a lurch
going on there.

1060
00:56:10,600 --> 00:56:14,720
出弯时有点转向过度。
A bit of over steer
on the way out.

1061
00:56:14,760 --> 00:56:17,000
不过变速箱好歹坚持到了
锤头弯。
Still, the gearbox has worked
all the way down
to Hammerhead.

1062
00:56:17,040 --> 00:56:19,120
所以，这算不错了！
So, that's not bad!

1063
00:56:19,160 --> 00:56:21,240
正在过弯……
这里的推头推得相当厉害。
He's going round...
He's got an awful lot
of under steer there.

1064
00:56:21,280 --> 00:56:23,280
我的天呐！
My God!

1065
00:56:23,320 --> 00:56:25,720
当然，必须记住
这车本来就挺沉的。
Of course, it is quite
a heavy car,
you have to remember that.

1066
00:56:31,640 --> 00:56:34,440
进入全速弯。
过这里他不得不稍微减点速。
Into the Follow Through.
He's going to have to
slow down a wee bit for this.

1067
00:56:34,480 --> 00:56:37,040
这可真是……重归重，
但它速度飞快！
That's very... It may be heavy
but it's very fast!

1068
00:56:39,040 --> 00:56:41,080
-听听这声浪。
-[呼啸而过]
-Listen to that noise.
-[ZOOMING]

1069
00:56:41,120 --> 00:56:43,280
[笑] 哇喔！
[LAUGHS] Whoa!

1070
00:56:43,320 --> 00:56:46,120
这玩意儿发出的声浪，
绝对堪称世间绝响之一。
It is one of the greatest
noises in the world
that that thing makes.

1071
00:56:46,160 --> 00:56:47,840
到了，倒数第二个弯，
Here he is,
second-to-last corner,

1072
00:56:47,880 --> 00:56:49,320
完美切过弯心。
kissing the apex perfectly.

1073
00:56:49,360 --> 00:56:52,720
绕过最后一个弯，冲线！
And round the last corner
and across the line.

1074
00:56:52,760 --> 00:56:57,040
-成绩是1分27秒1。
-[掌声]
-And the time is 1.27.1.
-[APPLAUSE]

1075
00:56:57,080 --> 00:57:00,720
这成绩排在……呃，这个嘛……
Which goes... Um, well...

1076
00:57:04,600 --> 00:57:06,360
哈蒙德：不过跟老款相比怎么样？
HAMMOND: How does it compare
to the old one though?

1077
00:57:06,400 --> 00:57:09,400
-呃，老款是1分36秒2。
-噢，掉到那么下面了，瞧。
-Well, that was 1.36.2.
-Ooh, it's down there, look.

1078
00:57:09,440 --> 00:57:11,760
-那是湿地成绩。
-那是我们这儿有史以来
最湿滑的一天。
-That was wet.
-It was the wettest day
we've ever had here.

1079
00:57:11,800 --> 00:57:13,520
所以那种情况也是没办法。
So, you can't
really do anything about that.

1080
00:57:13,560 --> 00:57:15,280
不过，接下来这事
你们可能会很想听听看。
I'll tell you what
you might be interested
in hearing, though.

1081
00:57:15,320 --> 00:57:17,680
我们测过DB9在这里的圈速。
We timed a DB9 round here.

1082
00:57:17,720 --> 00:57:18,600
你知道它跑了多少吗？
Do you know what time it did?

1083
00:57:19,600 --> 00:57:22,000
Vanquish S，1分27秒1。
Vanquish S, 1.27.1.

1084
00:57:22,040 --> 00:57:24,800
DB9，也是1分27秒1。
DB9, 1.27.1.

1085
00:57:24,840 --> 00:57:28,040
噢，真的假的？差了整整六万英镑，
圈速居然一模一样。
Oh, really? Sixty thousand
pound difference,
same time.

1086
00:57:28,080 --> 00:57:30,400
速度分毫不差。
罪魁祸首就是那台变速箱。
Exactly the same speed.
And it's this gearbox.

1087
00:57:30,440 --> 00:57:33,800
因为斯提格想要哪个挡，
它偏偏不给进哪个挡。
'Cause it wouldn't give
the Stig the gear he wanted.

1088
00:57:33,840 --> 00:57:36,880
简直快把他逼疯了。
他一直在嚷嚷：
“你怎么自己换挡了！啊！”
It was driving him nuts.
He kept saying,
"But you changed it! Argh!"

1089
00:57:36,920 --> 00:57:39,640
阿斯顿，求求你们收手吧！
Aston, please stop it!

1090
00:57:39,680 --> 00:57:43,720
赶紧打住吧！
给真正懂开车的车手配个像样的变速箱，行吗？
Just stop it!
Offer a proper gearbox
for proper drivers, you know?

1091
00:57:43,760 --> 00:57:46,080
因为车本身这么棒，
全让他们给糟蹋了。
'Cause it's such a great car
and they ruin it.

1092
00:57:46,120 --> 00:57:48,840
全被那台愚蠢至极的变速箱
给毁了。
They ruin it
with that stupid gearbox.

1093
00:57:48,880 --> 00:57:50,640
算了，趁他们在那换磁贴板，
Anyway, while they're
changing that,

1094
00:57:50,680 --> 00:57:52,640
我们来看看
那台法拉利表现如何。
let's see how
the Ferrari got on.

1095
00:57:54,360 --> 00:57:57,360
起步弹射，
在地上留下了两条粗壮的“11”字胎印，
Moving off the line,
he's leaving a huge
fat number 11,

1096
00:57:57,400 --> 00:58:00,960
因为显而易见，
法拉利的变速箱完全扛得住这股狂暴动力。
because, of course,
the gearbox in that
can take the power.

1097
00:58:01,000 --> 00:58:03,240
切入第一个弯……
瞧瞧这过弯姿态有多平稳。
Through the first corner...
Look how flat
that's cornering.

1098
00:58:03,280 --> 00:58:06,000
看起来可比那台阿斯顿敏捷多了。
It looks just so much more
nimble than the Aston.

1099
00:58:08,040 --> 00:58:10,040
瞧，过了芝加哥弯。
There he is, round Chicago.

1100
00:58:10,080 --> 00:58:13,320
你瞧，车身姿态控制得
也比阿斯顿好得多。
You see, that's looking
better controlled than
the Aston as well.

1101
00:58:16,040 --> 00:58:17,920
好，锤头弯。
他来了。
Right, Hammerhead.
Here he is.

1102
00:58:17,960 --> 00:58:20,280
瞧见没，完全没有阿斯顿马丁
那种让人抓狂的推头。
See, none of that under steer
that we got from
the Aston Martin.

1103
00:58:20,320 --> 00:58:21,840
走线死死咬住。
He just held the line.

1104
00:58:21,880 --> 00:58:23,920
出弯带着一点动力甩尾。
Little bit of power over steer
on the way out.

1105
00:58:23,960 --> 00:58:26,240
现在全速杀向高速穿梭弯（Follow Through）。
Heading down now to
the follow through.

1106
00:58:26,280 --> 00:58:29,160
很好，他得收油……
掠过轮胎墙时必须收一脚油门。
Good, he'll have to lift...
He has to lift
through the tyre wall.

1107
00:58:32,920 --> 00:58:35,640
当然，这台车的换挡拨片
确实比阿斯顿强，
Of course, the paddle gearbox
is better in this
than it is in the Aston,

1108
00:58:35,680 --> 00:58:38,440
但这感觉就像在说
得狂犬病总比得肉毒杆菌中毒强一样，
but that is like saying
rabies is better
than botulism,

1109
00:58:38,480 --> 00:58:41,920
他切过最后一个弯角，
冲线！
as he comes round
the last corner
and across the line.

1110
00:58:41,960 --> 00:58:44,920
成绩是：1分26秒8。
And the time is 1.26.8.

1111
00:58:44,960 --> 00:58:46,000
[观众鼓掌]
[AUDIENCE APPLAUD]

1112
00:58:46,040 --> 00:58:48,120
-所以……
-所以，它确实更快。
-So...
-So, it is quicker.

1113
00:58:50,280 --> 00:58:54,400
克拉克森：但实际上它只比
Vanquish快了零点三秒。
CLARKSON: It's actually only
0.3 of a second faster
than the Vanquish.

1114
00:58:54,440 --> 00:58:56,840
只比DB9快了区区零点三秒。
Only 0.3 of a second faster
than the DB9.

1115
00:58:56,880 --> 00:58:58,640
老实讲，
我原本以为它能快得更多。
I was expecting
more than that,
I must be honest.

1116
00:58:58,680 --> 00:59:01,600
但不管怎么说，
法拉利总算赢了一场比赛！
Nevertheless,
Ferrari has won a race!

1117
00:59:01,640 --> 00:59:02,680
我的老天爷啊！
Good Lord!

1118
00:59:02,720 --> 00:59:04,240
简直不可思议！
Isn't that amazing!

1119
00:59:04,280 --> 00:59:06,920
在这个爆炸性新闻中，
本期节目不得不结束了。
In fact, on that bombshell,
we have to end.

1120
00:59:06,960 --> 00:59:09,040
下周再见。
晚安！
See you again next week.
Goodnight!

1121
00:59:09,080 --> 00:59:10,000
[观众鼓掌]
[AUDIENCE APPLAUDING]

1122
00:59:10,020 --> 00:59:15,020
